    },
    "description": "<p>After a creature you can see performs an Accuracy Check for a <strong>ranged</strong> attack, you may spend an amount of Mind Points equal to <strong>【5 + the Result of that Accuracy Check】</strong> to have the attack automatically miss all of its targets. You can only use this Skill if you have a <strong>ranged weapon</strong> equipped, and it has no effect if the Accuracy Check was a <strong>critical success</strong>.</p>",
